       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVETRUNC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BIG-NUM    PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 12345.67.
       01 SMALL-INT  PIC 9(3).
       01 WITH-DEC   PIC 9(5)V9.
       01 SIGNED-NUM PIC S9(3) VALUE -45.
       01 UNSIGNED   PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE BIG-NUM TO SMALL-INT
           DISPLAY "TO 9(3):    " SMALL-INT
           MOVE BIG-NUM TO WITH-DEC
           DISPLAY "TO 9(5)V9:  " WITH-DEC
           MOVE SIGNED-NUM TO UNSIGNED
           DISPLAY "SIGN LOST:  " UNSIGNED
           STOP RUN.
